WEBVTT

00:01.060 --> 00:08.360
Witches

00:02.390 --> 00:03.240
<i>Witches.</i>

00:03.770 --> 00:09.360
<i>Since days of yore, one group has 
always stood at the pinnacle of sorcery:</i>

00:09.980 --> 00:13.630
<i>the original 17, known as Origin Witches,</i>

00:13.630 --> 00:23.350
<i>and the mighty lineage that inherited all of 
their magical power, craft, and knowledge.</i>

00:23.990 --> 00:26.930
<i>These are the witches of our age.</i>

00:27.690 --> 00:31.940
<i>Witches sometimes aid people 
and sometimes curse them.</i>

00:31.940 --> 00:35.680
<i>So how can one undo a witch's curse?</i>

00:35.840 --> 00:41.320
<b>1. A loving kiss from Prince Charming</b>

00:36.630 --> 00:41.320
<i>One way is a loving kiss 
from Prince Charming.</i>

00:42.100 --> 00:46.240
<i>Another is if the hateful witch 
has a change of heart.</i>

00:42.220 --> 00:46.240
<b>2. If the hateful witch has a change of heart</b>

00:47.500 --> 00:48.770
<i>And...</i>

02:30.500 --> 02:32.400
Damn it, Ashaf.

02:32.790 --> 02:35.160
She'd better really be here.

02:35.160 --> 02:38.510
Of course she's here. Although...

02:43.250 --> 02:45.310
Whether she's the one you're looking for...

02:46.000 --> 02:47.980
That's another story, Guideau.

02:49.940 --> 02:54.690
The Witch and the 
City of Blazing Red

02:55.180 --> 02:56.150
A witch?

02:56.150 --> 02:57.100
That's right.

02:57.420 --> 03:00.960
If you're looking for a witch,
 you should ask this person right here.

03:03.400 --> 03:05.310
Might you be a witch, perhaps?

03:06.150 --> 03:08.390
Apparently, they're looking for a witch.

03:08.390 --> 03:10.500
Oh, is that why you're visiting the city?

03:10.500 --> 03:11.670
Where is she?

03:12.330 --> 03:14.120
Tell me where the hell she is!

03:14.120 --> 03:15.210
Guideau.

03:16.100 --> 03:17.510
I beg your pardon.

03:17.510 --> 03:20.620
She can't contain her excitement 
when it comes to witches.

03:20.620 --> 03:23.010
You see, she has business with one.

03:23.010 --> 03:25.680
Oh, really? What does this witch look like?

03:25.680 --> 03:26.680
Dunno.

03:27.710 --> 03:32.920
But we're certainly lucky to find 
someone who knows a witch so soon.

03:32.920 --> 03:35.310
I wouldn't call it "luck" at all.

03:35.310 --> 03:38.320
I'm not the only one who knows Lady Witch.

03:38.320 --> 03:40.810
Everyone in the city knows her.

03:41.080 --> 03:44.910
I doubt you even need to ask around.

03:44.910 --> 03:46.470
What do you mean by that?

03:58.770 --> 03:59.700
Fire!

04:06.240 --> 04:09.430
Well... That's certainly quite the beast.

04:09.660 --> 04:13.390
Whether he's using transformation or 
manipulation, he must be a powerful mage.

04:13.390 --> 04:16.120
Hah! Already showin' themselves!

04:16.120 --> 04:17.280
It's a witch!

04:17.560 --> 04:18.770
Not at all.

04:18.770 --> 04:20.990
You've got it all wrong.

04:20.990 --> 04:23.460
That's not who you're looking for.

04:24.620 --> 04:25.650
You there...

04:29.150 --> 04:30.920
Could you hold this for me?

04:31.540 --> 04:33.880
Y-Yes, Lady Witch.

04:53.080 --> 04:54.870
Detain him!

04:56.180 --> 04:59.400
Amazing, Lady Witch Ione!

04:59.400 --> 05:03.890
What do we have here? 
Quite the celebrity, I see.

05:03.890 --> 05:06.660
Of course. She's the hero of our city.

05:06.660 --> 05:08.350
Hero? A witch?

05:08.350 --> 05:10.270
It's only fair judgment.

05:10.270 --> 05:11.740
You seem happy to say that.

05:11.740 --> 05:15.320
What student wouldn't be happy 
to see their mistress succeed?

05:15.560 --> 05:16.660
That so?

05:17.060 --> 05:20.060
I'll head over first to introduce you.

05:22.000 --> 05:25.530
Well, that explains that. "Lady Witch," huh?

05:25.960 --> 05:29.590
At least we didn't waste any time finding her.

05:31.240 --> 05:35.080
Guideau, our mission comes first.

05:35.080 --> 05:36.770
No acting on impulse...

05:38.330 --> 05:39.400
Oh, my.

05:39.720 --> 05:43.240
Lady Ione, as usual, thank you for your help.

05:43.240 --> 05:45.530
You're the guardian angel of this city.

05:46.470 --> 05:47.720
You give me too much credit.

05:47.720 --> 05:49.120
Mistress!

05:49.480 --> 05:52.350
Marie, are you done shopping?

05:52.350 --> 05:56.420
I'm sorry. I got distracted by all the chaos.

05:56.420 --> 05:58.620
I'll be sure to get everything later.

05:58.890 --> 06:01.210
After all, tonight's the big night.

06:01.210 --> 06:04.160
Don't you all remember 
what those witches did before?

06:04.160 --> 06:06.380
You're out of your mind 
to treat her like a hero!

06:06.380 --> 06:08.780
Mark my words, I'll kill you myself one day!

06:08.780 --> 06:11.050
Shut up! Hurry up and take him away.

06:12.850 --> 06:16.240
I've found you, you damn filthy witch!

06:19.880 --> 06:21.430
Huh? You...

06:25.600 --> 06:27.760
Damn it! You bitch!

06:27.760 --> 06:29.880
I know you've seen my face before!

06:30.930 --> 06:32.760
You know her?

06:32.760 --> 06:34.070
I'm not too sure.

06:34.070 --> 06:35.660
Shut up, you liar!

06:35.660 --> 06:36.680
That's enough!

06:36.680 --> 06:38.730
You messed with the wrong person!

06:38.730 --> 06:42.100
I dunno what made you believe in this bitch,

06:42.100 --> 06:44.210
but witches bring only
 disaster and misfortune.

06:44.210 --> 06:46.920
You're all gonna die if this shit continues!

06:46.920 --> 06:47.920
You little...

06:49.840 --> 06:51.480
Wh-What?

06:51.480 --> 06:52.920
Get off!

06:53.360 --> 06:56.210
My, my. It always goes like this.

06:56.210 --> 06:58.600
You need to leave it to me and stay back.

06:58.600 --> 07:01.140
Shut up, Ashaf! Screw your damn orders!

07:01.140 --> 07:03.330
My sincere apologies.

07:03.330 --> 07:06.150
Was this the plan all along?

07:06.150 --> 07:08.070
It's all a misunderstanding.

07:08.070 --> 07:10.870
We have no ill intent. But...

07:11.120 --> 07:15.220
Seeing as how you're a witch, 
we'd like to have a few words with you.

07:16.540 --> 07:17.570
Screw you!

07:17.570 --> 07:19.710
You're the one who attacked her!

07:20.120 --> 07:22.010
Hurry up and arrest them, too!

07:22.010 --> 07:23.800
They look suspicious enough!

07:24.070 --> 07:26.160
We will take our leave quickly, Guideau.

07:26.160 --> 07:28.100
What? Screw that!

07:28.100 --> 07:30.120
The witch is right there in front of us!

07:30.120 --> 07:33.950
Lady Witch, excuse us, 
but we'll call at another time.

07:34.390 --> 07:37.750
Our regards to you, too, little miss.

07:41.780 --> 07:43.900
What was all that about?

07:48.070 --> 07:52.450
Roughly 400 years ago, a wicked 
witch cast a curse on the city,

07:52.450 --> 07:55.680
turning it into a doomed land
 consumed by hellfire.

07:55.680 --> 08:01.710
But the wicked witch was defeated,
 and the curse was sealed.

08:01.710 --> 08:04.160
The curse was <i>sealed</i>?

08:04.550 --> 08:07.510
That's the supposed history of this city.

08:07.510 --> 08:11.160
This castle is where the 
curse is said to be sealed,

08:11.160 --> 08:13.870
as well as being the current 
residence of that witch.

08:14.140 --> 08:16.230
Or so says the pamphlet.

08:16.230 --> 08:19.500
How the hell can a witch 
live in a place like this?

08:19.500 --> 08:24.850
It means she's built a better reputation
 for herself in the last 400 years.

08:25.410 --> 08:26.600
Bullshit.

08:26.600 --> 08:30.120
Sure, to you, all witches are evil.

08:30.640 --> 08:34.560
But I suppose it does raise some questions.

08:34.560 --> 08:37.670
Oh. Did you two get invites, too?

08:37.670 --> 08:41.300
Not exactly. We have 
business with Lady Witch.

08:41.770 --> 08:43.350
Are we interrupting something?

08:43.350 --> 08:46.660
Well, there's a party tonight 
for the anniversary.

08:46.660 --> 08:49.450
Oh? The anniversary of what, exactly?

08:49.450 --> 08:52.380
Thanks for coming, everyone! Come on in!

08:56.580 --> 08:58.200
What are you two doing here?

08:58.200 --> 09:01.380
Picking up where we left off.
 Now, let me through.

09:01.380 --> 09:03.810
I told you to stay back and keep quiet.

09:03.810 --> 09:05.400
I'm afraid not!

09:05.400 --> 09:09.030
There's no way I'm letting bad 
people like you near my mistress.

09:09.030 --> 09:11.300
Huh? All witches have a screw loose!

09:11.300 --> 09:13.390
Why would you get so worked up defending one?

09:13.930 --> 09:16.860
That's exactly why I won't let you near her.

09:17.610 --> 09:22.990
In the past, this city treated witches 
terribly because of the wicked witch.

09:22.990 --> 09:28.250
My mistress grieved over this and 
put everything into helping the city.

09:28.880 --> 09:33.410
She protected the city from disasters
 and evildoers using magic,

09:33.410 --> 09:35.800
saving many people in the process.

09:36.380 --> 09:38.960
Including me.

09:40.690 --> 09:45.810
Years of hardship finally bore fruit, and 
she ended discrimination against witches.

09:45.810 --> 09:51.650
That's why I won't let her near anyone who 
berates her simply because she is a witch!

09:51.650 --> 09:55.190
My, how heartwarming. 
Really, that was quite moving.

09:55.190 --> 09:58.600
But I can't say I recommend 
believing everything you hear.

09:58.990 --> 10:00.940
What do you mean by that?

10:00.940 --> 10:04.730
The story of that sealed hellfire.

10:04.730 --> 10:08.020
It's supposedly a witch's curse, but...

10:10.410 --> 10:12.460
That doesn't quite add up.

10:13.390 --> 10:18.300
A witch's curse is never something 
that can just be "sealed."

10:18.570 --> 10:20.630
So if it really has been sealed,

10:20.630 --> 10:23.260
that makes it irrefutably 
something other than a curse.

10:23.260 --> 10:26.530
Which raises some curious questions.

10:26.530 --> 10:28.520
How could I believe any of that?

10:28.520 --> 10:30.480
I don't assume you would.

10:30.810 --> 10:34.070
But our world is filled with hidden truths.

10:34.480 --> 10:36.890
So I'm saying, just as you don't trust us,

10:36.890 --> 10:40.070
you shouldn't put too much 
trust in her, either.

10:40.070 --> 10:42.870
Every beautiful rose has its thorns.

10:42.870 --> 10:46.490
And witches always come with 
two things: secrets and danger.

10:46.490 --> 10:50.940
That's enough! Stop talking as if my 
mistress is plotting some evil scheme!

10:50.940 --> 10:54.160
How unbelievably rude. Leave now!

10:54.160 --> 10:56.180
One last thing.

10:56.790 --> 11:00.750
This anniversary that's happening... 
What is it for, exactly?

11:00.750 --> 11:04.300
I couldn't tell you. 
Mistress is the only one who knows.

11:07.790 --> 11:11.050
Great. We'll have to force
 our way in after all.

11:12.180 --> 11:15.650
Unfortunately, Guideau, I've found 
something I need to research.

11:15.650 --> 11:17.420
Let's go back to our hotel.

11:18.500 --> 11:21.380
Hopefully, it's nothing, 
but this is a witch we're facing.

11:21.380 --> 11:24.160
Better to be safe than sorry.

11:27.150 --> 11:29.230
Wow, they're so beautiful!

11:29.230 --> 11:31.030
I've never been here before!

11:32.750 --> 11:36.520
Mistress, the two people 
from earlier were just here.

11:36.520 --> 11:38.710
Oh? Did you turn them away?

11:38.710 --> 11:43.870
They were talking about you like you 
were evil, and I couldn't stand for it.

11:45.460 --> 11:46.450
Is that so?

11:54.400 --> 11:55.930
This is bad.

11:57.120 --> 11:59.460
The place where the fire was sealed...

11:59.460 --> 12:01.400
The meaning of today's date...

12:01.400 --> 12:06.390
A witch... And the true 
history buried in the past.

12:07.030 --> 12:10.030
"Anniversary," huh? Just as I thought.

12:10.030 --> 12:13.380
I wanted to go about this amicably for 
a change, but no chance of that now.

12:13.700 --> 12:15.990
I'll let you focus on your mission.

12:22.060 --> 12:24.430
There they are! Stop right there!

12:24.720 --> 12:27.630
Lady Witch has requested
 that we arrest you!

12:27.630 --> 12:30.980
That man's a mage. If you see 
any strange movements, open fire.

12:30.980 --> 12:33.030
Takin' orders from a damn witch?

12:33.030 --> 12:36.400
They are known to captivate 
people's hearts, you know.

12:36.680 --> 12:38.920
But this proves it, unfortunately.

12:38.920 --> 12:42.150
Lady Witch is indeed evil.

12:49.570 --> 12:53.310
My, my. You are such hard-working folks.

12:53.310 --> 12:55.170
That goddamn witch!

12:55.560 --> 12:58.210
I swear I'll sucker punch that face of hers!

13:09.410 --> 13:10.130
Huh?

13:11.200 --> 13:13.580
Did I doze off?

13:25.920 --> 13:28.850
Mistress, what in the world has...

13:28.850 --> 13:33.800
Don't be afraid. 
You're just becoming keys for me.

13:34.380 --> 13:39.130
I snuck a spell into your bodies
 during your training.

13:39.700 --> 13:42.070
What spell? Keys for what?

13:45.130 --> 13:49.120
To release the hellfire 
that sleeps in this city.

13:49.640 --> 13:52.290
B-But why would you...

13:52.820 --> 13:55.600
The wicked witch who once cursed this city...

13:56.020 --> 13:58.140
She was my grandmother.

13:58.140 --> 13:59.270
What?

13:59.270 --> 14:03.150
And as it happens, she <i>wasn't</i> a wicked witch.

14:03.750 --> 14:07.820
You see, she sealed away 
the blaze and saved the city.

14:08.470 --> 14:11.340
The cause of the fire remains a mystery.

14:11.340 --> 14:14.730
But witches got blamed for all disasters.

14:14.730 --> 14:17.830
That was an immutable law back then.

14:17.830 --> 14:23.000
Because of that nonsense, 
my heroic grandmother was murdered,

14:23.000 --> 14:26.950
and as a witch, I endured 
countless attempts on my life.

14:26.950 --> 14:28.930
Tell me, could you forgive that?

14:29.260 --> 14:32.800
N-No. It's monstrous.

14:33.470 --> 14:36.220
But you're being monstrous, too, Mistress!

14:36.220 --> 14:40.710
Please stop this! If we reveal the truth, 
we can surely find a better...

14:40.710 --> 14:43.150
I can't let this day pass me by.

14:43.460 --> 14:47.010
This day, exactly 417 years 
since the seal was put in place,

14:47.010 --> 14:49.750
is the one day its power weakens.

14:50.350 --> 14:54.830
I've spent 120 years waiting for this day.

14:55.290 --> 14:56.400
Look.

14:56.400 --> 14:58.890
The first lock opens.

15:01.210 --> 15:02.460
What the...

15:14.360 --> 15:17.800
Today marks the ultimate anniversary!

15:21.520 --> 15:22.980
I've got you now,

15:23.380 --> 15:24.960
ya stinkin' witch!

15:49.420 --> 15:52.840
Given your lack of skill, 
I'm amazed you dared to challenge me.

15:53.350 --> 15:56.760
Or did you have another goal in mind?

16:06.840 --> 16:08.400
Well, goodness.

16:08.400 --> 16:13.110
I would have liked to at least 
free the girls serving as keys.

16:13.550 --> 16:17.640
Forgive me. I should have been
 clearer with my warning.

16:18.600 --> 16:21.960
You seem to have caught on to my goal.

16:22.400 --> 16:24.790
Just who are you?

16:25.050 --> 16:26.130
Good question.

16:26.550 --> 16:28.820
Who could we be?

16:28.820 --> 16:31.430
Everyone has something to hide.

16:31.430 --> 16:33.710
Especially from witches.

16:33.710 --> 16:37.720
So you must not open your 
heart to a witch. Not ever.

16:38.160 --> 16:40.600
That's called "prejudice."

16:40.600 --> 16:45.060
Prejudice? What's prejudiced
about this disaster?

16:45.370 --> 16:48.630
Prejudice caused this hellfire.

16:49.410 --> 16:53.030
I'm told the "wicked witch"
was burned at the stake.

16:53.750 --> 16:56.440
I'm only giving as good as she got.

16:56.440 --> 16:58.490
You have no right to criticize.

16:58.490 --> 17:00.740
You're just lashing out!

17:00.740 --> 17:04.710
All the people who deserved 
your revenge are long gone!

17:05.060 --> 17:08.590
Everyone in the city adores you!

17:09.000 --> 17:11.610
You've done so much for this city.

17:11.610 --> 17:13.650
And all your time with us...

17:13.650 --> 17:17.930
What was it for, Mistress?

17:18.780 --> 17:21.740
Revenge isn't logical.

17:22.680 --> 17:26.530
I spent all that time just 
laying the groundwork.

17:26.530 --> 17:31.860
Gaining your trust made 
breaking the seal far easier.

17:31.860 --> 17:34.070
N-No...

17:34.570 --> 17:39.030
Getting revenge on someone whose face 
you can't see is like killing an insect.

17:39.460 --> 17:42.580
Making friends and really 
getting to know you

17:43.050 --> 17:46.320
let me appreciate you as targets.

17:46.320 --> 17:48.190
And look at the result.

17:48.190 --> 17:51.280
Watching you suffer...

17:51.960 --> 17:54.800
gives me such satisfaction!

17:55.090 --> 17:57.930
Revenge feels so wonderful!

17:57.930 --> 17:59.550
Stop! Don't unlock any more!

18:00.100 --> 18:03.320
I hate you all more than I can bear!

18:03.970 --> 18:08.100
I know exactly what you mean.

18:08.650 --> 18:11.680
I hate witches like crazy!

18:12.670 --> 18:14.660
What a resilient girl.

18:14.660 --> 18:17.470
I'm dying to bash your brains in right now,

18:17.470 --> 18:20.240
but you haven't given me a clear answer yet.

18:20.240 --> 18:21.910
Take a good look!

18:21.910 --> 18:23.160
Do you recognize me?

18:24.060 --> 18:26.330
Or this mark?!

18:31.430 --> 18:34.340
Oh, I see. That mark...

18:34.870 --> 18:37.760
You want to undo a witch's curse, don't you?

18:38.260 --> 18:42.100
Though I don't know why you're 
going about your search this way.

18:42.510 --> 18:46.010
But I see. So you want to be sure.

18:46.810 --> 18:50.560
A witch's curse, once cast, 
is so difficult to remove

18:50.980 --> 18:54.420
that it's become known as 
the "eternal malediction."

18:54.420 --> 18:57.070
There are only two ways to undo one.

18:57.470 --> 19:01.550
First, "a loving kiss from Prince Charming,"

19:01.550 --> 19:06.510
meaning a heartfelt kiss from 
your partner in pure, mutual love.

19:06.510 --> 19:10.420
Second, "if the hateful witch 
has a change of heart,"

19:10.420 --> 19:14.850
which means getting the one 
who cursed you to undo it.

19:14.850 --> 19:20.060
But I'm sorry to tell you that 
I'm not the witch you're looking for.

19:20.060 --> 19:23.850
So I can't undo your curse!

19:26.760 --> 19:30.430
I don't know which witch 
you have me confused with,

19:30.430 --> 19:32.700
but you wasted your time.

19:34.020 --> 19:36.690
You have one thing wrong yourself.

19:38.110 --> 19:43.530
You don't need to be the witch 
who cast the curse to lift it.

19:55.130 --> 19:56.290
Third...

20:00.980 --> 20:03.080
"Kiss a witch."

20:06.100 --> 20:10.180
There are more than two ways to undo a curse.

20:16.310 --> 20:17.230
Wha...

20:17.860 --> 20:18.820
What?

20:37.040 --> 20:40.740
Seriously, nothing beats your body!

20:45.980 --> 20:48.810
<i>What is this menacing aura?</i>

20:49.250 --> 20:52.430
<i>I don't sense powerful magic, and yet...</i>

20:52.810 --> 20:54.740
<i>Is this her true self?</i>

20:55.680 --> 20:58.400
I hope you're not too rusty, Guideau.

20:58.400 --> 21:01.030
We're about to find out!

21:28.810 --> 21:30.180
How about this?!

21:33.680 --> 21:35.790
Aren't you going to help?!

21:35.790 --> 21:39.560
Regrettably, I'm a mere first-rate mage.

21:40.020 --> 21:42.860
I'd be of no help at all in this battle.

21:43.590 --> 21:46.200
Besides, I'm not needed.

21:47.690 --> 21:52.680
You see, Guideau is the most beautiful
 and most terrifying of creatures,

21:53.850 --> 21:57.360
and the witches' greatest 
and only natural enemy.

21:59.120 --> 22:00.080
<i>Why?</i>

22:00.840 --> 22:02.380
<i>Why doesn't she stop?</i>

22:02.910 --> 22:05.720
Get ready...

22:06.610 --> 22:08.010
for a gut punch!

22:17.690 --> 22:23.270
<i>What is... this creature?</i>

22:49.610 --> 22:52.090
I see they're finally getting 
the fire under control.

22:53.930 --> 22:56.220
Another dead end, damn it!

22:56.220 --> 22:59.060
It really is a shame.

22:59.060 --> 23:02.810
This method can undo 
the curse, but not forever.

23:02.810 --> 23:06.530
For a more permanent solution, 
we really need to find <i>her</i>.

23:09.240 --> 23:10.760
I see more collapsed over there!

23:15.850 --> 23:17.170
Are you okay?

23:18.820 --> 23:23.970
For better or worse, I guess you 
can't judge people by appearances.

23:26.540 --> 23:30.150
Who in the world are you two?

23:30.150 --> 23:34.760
Bringing witches back 
to the Order is our job.

23:34.760 --> 23:35.850
The Order?

23:35.850 --> 23:39.120
It tackles all manner 
of magic-related trouble.

23:39.610 --> 23:44.770
An occult organization of magic, 
by magic, for magic.

23:44.770 --> 23:47.580
That's us, the Order of Magical Resonance.

23:48.660 --> 23:50.930
Now then, Guideau, let's hurry home.

23:50.930 --> 23:53.960
